    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "C.  213 M² 4 Bedroom & 3 Bathroom Detached Dormer Bungalow located in the quaint village of Barndarrig.  This is a beautifully maintained and light filled family home with well laid out accommodation.  Set in a small, exclusive quiet cul-de-sac estate of just 9 homes.  With large surrounding gardens, natural gas central heating, uPVC Double Glazing and ample off street parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nPORCH   (3.048M X 1.236)\r\nLight filled area with timber ceiling.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY   (3.882M X 1.669M) + (3.383M X 1.278M) + (2.668M X 1.996M)\t\r\nWith tiled flooring and stairs to first floor.\r\n\r\nGUEST WC   (1.473M X 2.366M)\t\r\nAccessed off the entrance hallway.  With white and chrome suite, wc and whb. Tiled flooring and partially tiled walls.  Ceiling coving and shaver light over sink. \r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM   (4.183M X 4.692M) + (2.099M X 1.090M)\t\r\nTastefully decorated, this is a spacious and bright sitting room with large bay window overlooking the front garden.  With laminate flooring and Limestone fireplace with solid fuel burning stove.  Dado rail, wall panelling and ceiling coving.  Double doors leading to kitchen.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 4   (3.272M X 3.685M) + (1.494M X 1.385M)\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with solid wood flooring.\r\n\r\nDINING ROOM   (3.658M X 3.371M)\r\nWith laminate flooring and ceiling coving (currently used as a home office).\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM   (4.462M X 5.852M)\t\r\nVery generous, fully fitted Kitchen incorporating hob and Servis oven, extractor fan, Beko dishwasher and Hotpoint fridge.  Tiled flooring and splashback.  Ceiling coving and recessed lighting.  French doors opening onto the front garden.  \r\n\r\nSUNROOM   (2.770M X 3.500M)\r\nBeautiful, light room with tiled flooring and ceiling coving.\r\n\r\nUTILITY ROOM   (2.886M X 3.300M)\t\r\nWith built in kitchen units and sink.  Tiled flooring and splashback.  Ample storage.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nLANDING   (0.924M X 1.970M) + (4.443M X 1.537M)\r\nWith carpeted and laminate flooring, velux window, recessed lighting and attic access.  Location of hot press.\r\nDecorative stone tile wall.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2   (3.279M X 4.821M)  \r\nWith laminate flooring and built in, ceiling to floor, double wardrobe.  Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nEN-SUITE   (2.412M X 2.056M) + (1.376M X 0.919M)  \t\t\r\nEn-suite with tiled flooring and white suite, wc and whb.  Built in shower unit (Triton T90si). Partially tiled walls and tiled splashback.  Vanity unit under sink.  Heated towel rail, light over sink and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3   (2.457M X 4.4M) + (2.496M X 1.380M) + (1.374M X 0.919M)  \t\r\nLocated to the front with laminate flooring and recessed ceiling lighting.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM   (2.703M X 1.812M) + (1.369M X 0.921M)\t\t\t\r\nWith tiled flooring and partially tiled walls.  Tiled splashback and heated towel rail.  Glass sink unit, recessed lighting and half shower door over bath.\r\n\r\nMAIN BEDROOM   (5M X 4.315M) + (0.925M X 1.376M)  \t\r\nVery spacious and light filled room located to the front of the property with laminate flooring and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nEN-SUITE   (1.810M X 2.495M) +0.891M X 1.378M)\r\nWith tiled flooring and splashback.  Mains built in shower – fully tiled.  White wc and glass sink unit.  Mirror and light over sink.\r\n\r\nWALK IN WARDROBE   (1.843M X 1.169M)\r\nWith carpeted flooring, clothes rail and shelving.\r\n\r\nGARDENS\r\nNo. 3 stands on a generously sized site C. 0.3 Acre (C.1,200 M²).  The front garden is in lawn with mature hedgerow, timber fence and block wall boundaries.  Gated front entrance with mature shrubbery and plants.  There is ample off street parking for at least four cars.  The rear garden is in lawn with a beautiful Garden Room (C. 14M²) supplied with electricity and French doors leading out on to the lawn.   This is accessed by a gravelled pathway from the house and would be very suitable for a Home Office.  There is also a paved patio to the side of the house allowing for outside dining and a raised, decked area to the back side of the rear garden.\r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nMains Water & Sewerage, Natural Gas Central Heating System, \r\nOutside lighting and tap.\r\nBER – C1  -  (BER Number: 106338569)    \r\n\r\nGENERAL\r\nNo. 3 The Field is an extensive detached dormer bungalow with generously sized surrounding gardens, located \r\nin a small quiet cul-de-sac, of 9 houses, in Barndarrig Village.  Barndarrig is located C. 11 Km south west of Wicklow Town, C. 15 Km north of Arklow Town and C. 3.5 Km north east of Redcross Village. The N11 and M11 Motorway are just minutes drive away.  A short distance away are Brittas Bay and Ennereilly Beaches, The European and Blainroe Golf Clubs, national schools located in Redcross, Barndarrig & Brittas Bay, and secondary schools in the nearby towns of Arklow and Wicklow, with school bus routes to each secondary school available.  Local access to a shop/petrol station and bus routes.  This is a bright and spacious light filled family home which comes onto the market in lovely condition, boasting well laid out tasteful accommodation.   Set in the heart of the County Wicklow countryside, The Field in Barndarrig is the perfect location for those looking for a peaceful laid back country life style, yet located close to the bustling towns of Wicklow and Arklow, with convenient close by access onto the motorway.  Viewing is a must."
